flowchart LR
    accTitle: How TTT turns a document into answers
    accDescr: A PDF or DOCX is read into elements by the content elementizer, arranged into a tree of sections, indexed by word symbols, and stored as a graph. A question is turned into the same symbols, matched against the graph, and answered with ranked passages that carry their page and heading path.
    DOC["PDF or DOCX"] --> CE["Read elements<br>(content elementizer)"]
    CE --> TREE["Tree of sections,<br>paragraphs, tables"]
    TREE --> IDX["Index by word symbols<br>(1, 2 and 3 word phrases)"]
    IDX --> G[("Document graph<br>SQLite")]
    Q["Question"] --> M["Match the same symbols"]
    G --> M
    M --> R["Ranked passages<br>+ page + heading path"]
